  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1902.06 “Designated river” means “designated river” as defined in RSA 483:4, VIII, as reprinted in Appendix B. The term includes a river segment.\n\nSource. #7901, eff 5-29-03 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1900) (formerly Env-Ws 1902.06); ss by #9936, eff 5-28-11; ss by #12695, eff 12-22-18 (formerly Env-Wq 1902.09)",
